Subject: Multi writes and multi reads on a local TCP socket.
Date: 1999/05/20
Message-ID: <37441C09.A3AD400C@orga.com>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 480150834
X-Nntp-Posting-Host: 194.122.136.143
