Read the Digital/Tru64 UNIX FAQ:
http://ftp.digital.com/pub/Digital/dec-faq/Digital-UNIX

	M18. Why does dxaccounts tells me that the password 
	and group files are locked?

	If a dxaccounts process exits ungracefully (e.g. if 
	a kill -9 is used) then it sometimes leaves a file 
	in /etc called .AM_is_running. Deleting this file 
	will solve the problem.
